1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:08,029
I've been watching your species for 4,297 years, and I can tell you: this is the fork.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:14,300
Right here. Same planet, same technology, same questionable dietary choices.

3
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:20,240
The only variable is where one percent of the money goes. One percent.

4
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:26,820
That's the rounding error that decides whether your grandchildren colonize Mars or become fertilizer.

5
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:37,640
Path A: Moronia. You do nothing. (Your specialty.) The ever-growing dark economy of cybercrime and A.I.-driven conflict

6
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:41,400
offers your smartest people better salaries than hospitals do.

7
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:49,900
So they take them, because they have student loans. The singularity happens, but it's an inverse one, a hockey stick pointing

8
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:58,480
straight down. Antibiotics fail. Global systems collapse in the boringly predictable order that every civilization-collapse

9
00:00:58,480 --> 00:01:06,120
textbook warned you about. Warlords with A.I. armies fight over the scraps in a radioactive wasteland.

10
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:11,000
Earth's final epitaph: "They had the instructions. They ate them.".

11
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:21,400
Path B: Wishonia. You pass a one percent treaty. The brightest minds, suddenly offered more money to cure cancer than to

12
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:30,340
hack banks, reluctantly start curing cancer. The feedback loop is immediate and, frankly, obvious: funding produces cures,

13
00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:34,180
cures produce public support, support produces more funding.

14
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:44,040
By 2040, aging is reversible and suffering is optional. By 2050, you've cured death, solved physics, and are arguing about

15
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:52,170
which galaxy to visit first. (You'll argue about anything. I've watched you argue about the color of a dress for three years.).

16
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:59,380
The Only Variable. Same species. Same year. Same technology.

17
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:08,280
Same brains, same atoms, same Tuesday afternoon. The only difference: where one percent of the money goes.

18
00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:14,260
You're choosing right now, by the way. Doing nothing is choosing Path A.

19
00:02:14,780 --> 00:02:18,140
Path A doesn't require a vote. It doesn't require anything.

20
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,060
That's why it's winning.
